sequenceDiagram
  participant S as n8n 07:00 JST
  participant P as python-jobs
  participant G as GitHub API
  participant R as Reports
  participant K as Uptime Kuma
  S->>P: POST /jobs/github-dev-snapshot
  P->>G: repos + open issues/PRs (4 calls)
  P->>G: per active repo: Actions, last commit
  G-->>P: JSON (GET only)
  P->>P: diff, alerts, keep fuller report of the day
  P->>R: dated .md, latest.md, snapshot JSON
  P->>K: push up or down
  P-->>S: summary counts
